{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ojiQtOj0Ex1788018285.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">律政司司長林定國率團，繼續在烏茲別克訪問，深化兩地法律合作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SJ.VISIT-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026UhsYWQmaGL1788018314.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SJ.VISIT-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">代表團由法律、金融和會計專業等跨專業成員組成。林定國和烏茲別克司法部部長會面，雙方簽訂合作備忘錄，交流法律框架和政策，並就人工智能(AI)在法律界的應用作經驗分享，又在交流敘餐中，介紹香港在「一國兩制」下獨特的制度優勢，並探討合作機會。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T15:59:35.605970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}